In rust we have 2 data types
- Scalar Type
    1. Integer Type

    Integers are of two types, Signed and Unsigned integer


    | Length | Signed | Unsigned | 
    | --- | --- | --- |
    | 8 bit | i8 | u8 |
    | 16 bit | i16 | u16 | 
    | 32 bit | i32 | u32 |
    | 64 bit | i64 | u64 | 
    | 128 bit | i128 | u128 |
    | arch | isize | usize |


    Integer Literals are of few types.


    | Number Literal | Example | 
    | ---- | ----- |
    | Decimal | 98_222 |
    | Hex | 0xff |
    | Octal | Oo77 | 
    | Binary | Ob1111_0000 | 
    | Byte(u8 only) | b'A' |


    2. Floating-Point Type
    There are two types of floating point type,f32 and f64

    3. Boolean Type

    4. Character Type

- Compound Type
    1. Tuple Type
    2. Array Type

